; atc_change.ngc — Carousel automatic tool change (OpenPnP four-positions style)
;
; Called by flexihal_atc.c tool_change() when the requested tool is in the
; carousel.  Parameters set by the plugin before this macro runs:
;
;   #4900 = incoming tool number
;   #4901 = incoming carousel pocket number
;   #4902 = outgoing tool pocket (0 = outgoing tool was hand-loaded, skip return)
;
; Geometry parameters — set once by G65 P200 in your startup macro:
;
;   #4920-#4922  Position 1: Safe XYZ
;   #4923-#4925  Position 2: Approach XYZ
;   #4926-#4928  Position 3: Engage XYZ
;   #4929-#4931  Position 4: Exit XYZ
;   #4932        Feed rate for all carousel positioning moves (mm/min)
;
; Pocket positioning is handled externally (dedicated axis or separate MCU).
; Add the appropriate motion or M-code in the marked sections below.
;
; Unload sequence:  P1 → P2 → P3 [open drawbar]  → P4
; Load sequence:    P4 → P3 [close drawbar] → P2 → P1

; ── Move to safe position (P1) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
G65P201
G53 G0 Z#4922
G53 G0 X#4920 Y#4921

; ── Unload: return outgoing tool if it came from the carousel ─────────────────
o100 if [#4902 GT 0]

  ; ── [CAROUSEL POSITIONING — outgoing tool] ───────────────────────────────
  ; Position the carousel to pocket #4902 here.
  ; Example: G0 A[#4902 * 18.0]   (if A axis drives the carousel)
  ;          or issue an M-code to the carousel MCU
  G65 P7 S3 F16 R1 A1#4902
  G65 P201

  ; Approach outgoing pocket (P2)
  G53 G1 X#4923 Y#4924 F#4932
  G53 G1 Z#4925 F#4932

  ; Engage outgoing pocket (P3) — deposit tool, open drawbar
  G53 G1 X#4926 Y#4927 Z#4928 F#4932
  $DRBO
  G4 P0.5

  ; Exit outgoing pocket (P4)
  G53 G1 X#4929 Y#4930 Z#4931 F#4932

o100 endif

; ── [CAROUSEL POSITIONING — incoming tool] ───────────────────────────────────
; Position the carousel to pocket #4901 here.
; Example: G0 A[#4901 * 18.0]   (if A axis drives the carousel)
;          or issue an M-code to the carousel MCU
  G65 P7 S3 F16 R1 A1#4901
  G65 P201

; ── Load: pick up incoming tool ───────────────────────────────────────────────

; Descend to incoming pocket (P4 → P3) — clamp tool
G53 G1 X#4929 Y#4930 Z#4931 F#4932
G53 G1 X#4926 Y#4927 Z#4928 F#4932
$DRBC
G4 P0.5

; Withdraw from pocket (P3 → P2 → P1)
G53 G1 X#4923 Y#4924 Z#4925 F#4932
G53 G0 Z#4922
G53 G0 X#4920 Y#4921

; ── Measure new tool ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
$TCMEASURE

M2
